#. module: wine_merchant
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:wine_merchant.homepage
msgid "&amp;nbsp;Our Selection<br/>"
msgstr "我们的产品系列<br/>"

#. module: wine_merchant
#: model_terms:event.event,description:wine_merchant.event_event_2
msgid "**Course Highlights:**"
msgstr "**课程特色：**"

#. module: wine_merchant
#: model_terms:event.event,description:wine_merchant.event_event_2
msgid ""
"**Expert Instructors:** Learn from seasoned professionals in the field, "
"including winemakers, sommeliers, and viticulturists, who will share their "
"knowledge and passion for wine."
msgstr ""
"**专家主讲** ：学员可向业内经验丰富的专业人士学习，包括酿酒师、侍酒师、葡萄培"
"植者等，他们会分享自己的专业知识，以及对葡萄酒的热爱。"

#. module: wine_merchant
#: model_terms:event.event,description:wine_merchant.event_event_2
msgid ""
"**Hands-On Experience:** Participate in practical workshops, vineyard "
"visits, and tastings that will enhance your sensory skills and deepen your "
"appreciation for different wine styles and regions."
msgstr ""
"**亲身体验** ：活动包括动手制作的工作坊、品酒会，以及参观葡萄园，提升您的感官"
"能力，加深您对不同风格及产区的葡萄酒的欣赏。"

#. module: wine_merchant
#: model_terms:event.event,description:wine_merchant.event_event_2
msgid ""
"**In-Depth Curriculum:** Explore the science of viticulture, fermentation "
"processes, and the art of blending. Each module is crafted to provide a "
"thorough understanding of the wine-making journey from grape to glass."
msgstr ""
"**课程深入** ：探索葡萄栽培的科学、发酵过程，以及酒液调配的艺术。每个主题单元"
"都是精心设计，旨在协助您全面了解葡萄由果实变成杯中美酒的整个酿造过程。"

#. module: wine_merchant
#: model_terms:event.event,description:wine_merchant.event_event_2
msgid ""
"**Networking Opportunities:** Connect with fellow wine lovers and industry "
"professionals, expanding your network and enhancing your learning experience."
msgstr ""
"**交流机会** ：与其他葡萄酒爱好者及业内专业人士建立联系，拓展您的人脉，提升整"
"体学习体验。"

#. module: wine_merchant
#: model_terms:event.event,description:wine_merchant.event_event_2
msgid "**Who Should Enroll:**"
msgstr "**适合参加人士：**"

#. module: wine_merchant
#: model:website.page,url:wine_merchant.website_page_8
msgid "/contactus"
msgstr ""

#. module: wine_merchant
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:wine_merchant.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"2. Add products to your cart, choose your favorite <strong>payment provider</"
"strong> and <strong>delivery method</strong>"
msgstr ""
"2.将产品加入购物车，然后选择您想使用的<strong>付款服务商</strong>及<strong>送"
"货方式</strong>"

#. module: wine_merchant
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:wine_merchant.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Auto-BoM (Product Breakdown):</b> Automatically manage the inventory "
"\"breakdown\" of bulk items (e.g., a crate of wine) into sub-products "
"(individual bottles) and empty packaging assets."
msgstr ""
"<b>自动 BoM（产品拆分）：</b> 自动管理散装商品（例如一箱葡萄酒）拆分为子产品"
"（单瓶）和空包装资产的库存“拆分”。"

#. module: wine_merchant
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:wine_merchant.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Automate Compliance:</b> Generate weekly excise reports by license and "
"track legal document statuses."
msgstr "<b>合规自动化：</b> 按许可证生成每周消费税报表，并跟踪法律文件状态。"

#. module: wine_merchant
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:wine_merchant.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Automate Deposit Surcharges:</b> Automatically link deposit products (and "
"their associated taxes) to sellable items, ensuring the correct deposit "
"amount is charged without manual entry."
msgstr ""
"<b>押金附加费自动化：</b> 自动将押金产品（及其相关税项）关联到可售商品，确保"
"无需手动输入即可收取正确的押金金额。"

#. module: wine_merchant
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:wine_merchant.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>CRM App</b>: Cultivate lasting relationships with wine lovers by managing "
"interactions and tracking potential\n"
"            leads for private sales or memberships."
msgstr ""
"<b>CRM 应用</b>：通过管理互动并跟踪私人销售或会员的潜在\n"
"            线索，与葡萄酒爱好者建立长久关系。"

#. module: wine_merchant
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:wine_merchant.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Define &amp; Assign:</b> Create excise categories and link them to "
"products with specific reporting units."
msgstr ""
"<b>定义并分配：</b> 创建消费税类别，并将其与具有特定申报单位的产品关联。"

#. module: wine_merchant
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:wine_merchant.ir_ui_view_3281
msgid "<b>Designed</b> for companies"
msgstr "<b>设计</b> 为公司"

#. module: wine_merchant
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:wine_merchant.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Events App</b>: Engage your community by organizing and managing "
"registrations for wine tastings, workshops, and\n"
"            exclusive release parties."
msgstr ""
"<b>活动应用</b>：通过组织和管理品酒会、工作坊和\n"
"            独家发布会的报名，与您的社群互动。"

#. module: wine_merchant
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:wine_merchant.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Inventory App</b>: Manage your cellar with precision, ensuring structure "
"and clarity for thousands of bottles,\n"
"            vintages, and locations."
msgstr ""
"<b>库存应用</b>：精准管理您的酒窖，让数千瓶酒、\n"
"            年份和库位都结构清晰、一目了然。"

#. module: wine_merchant
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:wine_merchant.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Manage Fiscal Deposits:</b> Monitor stock movements (Entry/Exit) "
"specifically for warehouses designated as fiscal deposits."
msgstr ""
"<b>管理税务寄存仓库：</b> 专门针对被指定为税务寄存仓库的仓库，监控库存移动"
"（入库/出库）。"

#. module: wine_merchant
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:wine_merchant.ir_ui_view_3281
msgid ""
"<b>My Company</b><br/>250 Executive Park Blvd, Suite 3400 <br/> San "
"Francisco CA 94134 <br/>United States"
msgstr ""
"<b>My Company</b><br/>250 Executive Park Blvd, Suite 3400 <br/> San "
"Francisco CA 94134 <br/>United States"

#. module: wine_merchant
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:wine_merchant.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Point of Sale App</b>: Deliver a smooth in-store experience with an "
"intuitive interface that handles bottle and\n"
"            case sales seamlessly."
msgstr ""
"<b>POS 应用</b>：凭借直观的界面提供流畅的店内体验，轻松处理单瓶和\n"
"            整箱销售。"

#. module: wine_merchant
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:wine_merchant.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Protect Margins:</b> Calculate customer discounts independently of excise "
"taxes to ensure tax liabilities don't eat into your profit."
msgstr "<b>保护利润：</b> 独立于消费税计算客户折扣，确保税负不会侵蚀您的利润。"

#. module: wine_merchant
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:wine_merchant.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Purchase App</b>: Automate the replenishment of your stock by tracking "
"purchase orders and managing supplier\n"
"            relationships effectively."
msgstr ""
"<b>采购应用</b>：通过跟踪采购订单并有效管理供应商\n"
"            关系，自动完成库存补货。"

#. module: wine_merchant
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:wine_merchant.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Sales App</b>: Streamline your B2B and B2C transactions by creating "
"professional quotations and sales orders\n"
"            efficiently."
msgstr ""
"<b>销售应用</b>：高效创建专业的报价单和销售订单，\n"
"            简化您的 B2B 和 B2C 交易。"

#. module: wine_merchant
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:wine_merchant.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Smart Fiscal Positions:</b> Automatically include or exclude excise taxes "
"based on whether a partner holds their own fiscal deposit."
msgstr ""
"<b>智能应税设定：</b> 根据合作伙伴是否拥有自己的税务寄存仓库，自动计入或排除"
"消费税。"

#. module: wine_merchant
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:wine_merchant.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Smart Replenishment:</b> Trigger automated rules to replenish sub-"
"products from bulk stock as soon as they are needed for sale."
msgstr "<b>智能补货：</b> 触发自动规则，在需要销售时立即从散装库存补货子产品。"

#. module: wine_merchant
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:wine_merchant.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Streamline Returns:</b> Capture returned bottles or crates during the "
"delivery process or directly at the Point of Sale to credit customers "
"instantly."
msgstr ""
"<b>简化退货：</b> 在送货过程中或直接在 POS 上记录退回的酒瓶或酒箱，立即为客户"
"贷记。"

#. module: wine_merchant
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:wine_merchant.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Transparent Accounting:</b> Clearly expose deposit totals on sales orders "
"and invoices through dedicated tax groups for better customer clarity."
msgstr ""
"<b>透明的会计处理：</b> 通过专用税项组在销售订单和发票上清晰显示押金总额，让"
"客户更清楚。"

#. module: wine_merchant
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:wine_merchant.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>eCommerce App</b>: Expand your reach beyond the shop floor by showcasing "
"your wine selection and enabling secure\n"
"            online purchases."
msgstr ""
"<b>电子商务应用</b>：展示您的葡萄酒精选并支持安全的\n"
"            在线购买，将业务拓展到实体店之外。"

